00:02:03.883 --> 00:02:24.182
There is a mystery at school: the birthday cake is missing! Malis becomes a detective. She looks for a clue and finds a chocolate fingerprint on the door. There are three suspects. A witness says she saw a boy with a big smile. Malis asks questions and solves the case: it was the teacher's dog!

